    "title_en": "Sharp $L_p$-Regularity for Quantum Markov Semigroups",
    "abstract_en": "We determine the sharp universal constants in positive-input $L_p$-regularity for finite-dimensional quantum Markov semigroups with a faithful invariant state. For $1<p<\\infty$, they are $p\\sin(π/p)/(2(p-1))$ under KMS symmetry and $\\frac{p}{2(p-1)}\\tan(\\fracπ{2}\\min\\{1/p,1-1/p\\})$ without a symmetry assumption, with the endpoint values at $p=1$ given by $π/2$ and $π/4$, respectively.",
